 `The /doctor:update command is documented in the README` puts `/create:readme (start)` on the top row. `/doctor:deep-loop (run, add-only)` as third row on deep-loop refusals falls under P007."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/verify-4/report.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794680200569,"end":1794680200766}}}}
