 D2 Security — holdout hygiene in the scorer and live capture, guard reach\n - [ ] D3 Traceability — docs against code, spec/checklist claims, feature-catalog claims\n - [ ] D4 Maintainability — test pinning, dead fields, naming, follow-on change cost\n \n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md\",\"oldString\":\"- [ ] D1 Correctness — refusal/or-list suppression, is-the question, shell-read start, heredoc close, run-log `offeredAs`\",\"newString\":\"- [x] D1 Correctness — refusal/or-list suppression, is-the question, shell-read start, heredoc close, run-log `offeredAs`\"}"},"time":{"start":1794680835651,"end":1794680843286}}}}
