{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794681446248,"sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad87ffe4Yqg6PDGQGxiHx","part":{"partID":"prt_1db599910001HIOIvIy8mvIKl3","sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad87ffe4Yqg6PDGQGxiHx","messageID":"msg_1db5958bc0010zdBIkw3NSqJe3","type":"tool","id":"call_b3f93391be874b8fb76ec78f","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n \"phase_synthesis|stopReason|synthesis\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml | head -30; echo \"--- runner\"; rg -n \"stopReason|maxIterationsReached|FANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE|synthesis\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/*.cjs .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/*.cjs 2>/dev/null | rg \"stopReason|maxIterations|FANOUT_LINEAGE\" | head -20"},"output":"8:action: Run deep-review loop from initialization through synthesis\n220:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n222:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n373:          applies_when: \"legacy_migration_detected == true and the branch taken resumes the session or goes to synthesis; never on restart or cancel\"\n419:          log: \"Prior session already completed. Either archive the completed review/ tree and start a fresh session, or jump straight to synthesis with the existing artifacts.\"\n420:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n777:               stopReason = \"blockedStop\"\n782:             a) if iteration_count >= max_iterations: set decision = \"STOP\", stopReason = \"maxIterationsReached\", hard_stop_reason = \"max_iterations_reached\", preserve any failed legal-stop gates as terminal evidence, and proceed to synthesis without legal-stop veto\n785:             Operator stop reasons (`maxIterationsReached`, `manualStop`, `userPaused`, unrecoverable `error`) are terminal ceilings. They do not hide failed gates; they record them in synthesis and stop dispatch.\n820:               stopRea