{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794681520593,"sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad87ffe4Yqg6PDGQGxiHx","part":{"partID":"prt_1db5aa418001fTukfPKB9BrOBa","sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad87ffe4Yqg6PDGQGxiHx","messageID":"msg_1db5a8f27001YNtSD9rCWtAWIv","type":"tool","id":"call_0a350630b52341ab93793572","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Pairing each brief check with its pinning test row: it separates \"the fix holds\" from \"the test only covers the easy form\" (iteration 1).\n- Reading the holdout gate as an ordering property (`label` → `holdout` → `loadSession`) instead of grepping for the word holdout: it proves the prompt cannot be reached (iteration 3).\n- Timing the new delimiter on growing lists: a flat curve rules out the ReDoS class without a security tool (iteration 3).","oldString":"- Pairing each brief check with its pinning test row: it separates \"the fix holds\" from \"the test only covers the easy form\" (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -94,8 +94,10 @@\n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n - Importing `command-attach.ts` directly with Node's type stripping: it is the actual module, so a gate result is observed behavior rather than a regex reading (iteration 1).\n - Pairing each brief check with its pinning test row: it separates \"the fix holds\" from \"the test only covers the easy form\" (iteration 1).\n+- Reading the holdout gate as an ordering property (`label` → `holdout` → `loadSession`) instead of grepping for the word holdout: it proves the prompt cannot be reached (iteration 3).\n+- Timing the new delimiter on growing lists: a flat curve rules out the ReDoS class without a security tool (iteration 3).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Pairing each brief check with its pinning test row: it separates \\\"the fix holds\\\" from \\\"the test only covers the easy form\\\" (iteration 1).\\n- Reading the holdout gate as an ordering property (`label` → `holdout` → `loadSession`) instead of grepping for the word holdout: it proves the prompt cannot be reached (iteration 3).\\n- Timing the new delimiter on growing lists: a flat curve rules out the ReDoS class without a security tool (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- Pairing each brief check with its pinning test row: it separates \\\"the fix holds\\\" from \\\"the test only covers the easy form\\\" (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794681512984,"end":1794681520593}}}}
